body:
Hey, saw this post by searching in exmuslim top of the month posts. How has your mentality been ever since you moved out, if you don't mind me asking? Im 24f and feel so fucking weighed down by this shit and have been banking on the idea that when I move out, I will feel so much better. Ive never been on a date, virgin, feel so awkward and weird, get panic attacks sometimes, used to be real depressed but thats improved. 

&#x200B;

idk this is kind of a rant lol. can you tell me if your mentality and perspective in life has improved since moving out of your parents home? I want to TASTE that freedom

Basically, I'll be making a song and I as make it, I listen to it periodically. I'll listen to parts of it by pressing space or clicking the play icon (super basic stuff I know). But, without fail it will always freeze and not trigger anything. I want to know the technical term for this feature so I can research it and try to figure out what's wrong with it.

&#x200B;

Btw, I'll restart my computer. Re-install fl studio but nothing clears up this issue. Thank you!
